{
    "title": "Pok\u00e9mon Masters EX",
    "description": "THE MAIN STORY\u2019S ARCEUS ARC UNFOLDS!\r\nSync pairs awaken the power of arc suits\u2014outfits blessed by Arceus\u2014showing the powerful depths of the bond between Pok\u00e9mon and Trainer!\r\n\r\nTEAM UP WITH SYNC PAIRS FROM EVERY REGION!\r\nTeam up and interact with Trainers from the Hisui region, the Paldea region, and everywhere in between!\r\n\r\nGET TO KNOW YOUR FAVORITE TRAINERS!\r\nInteract with Trainers in the Trainer Lodge to deepen your bond and get special photos and stories!\r\n\r\nTRAINERS DON SPECIAL OUTFITS!\r\nTrainers appear wearing outfits exclusive to Pok\u00e9mon Masters EX! Enjoy original stories connected to those outfits, too!\r\n\r\nHATCH EGGS & TEAM UP!\r\nHatch Eggs to get new Pok\u00e9mon! Add hatched Pok\u00e9mon to your team, and battle your way to the top!\r\n\r\nENTER THE FRAY WITH A CUSTOM TEAM!\r\nAssemble Trainers and Pok\u00e9mon to take on battles! Create a team all your own, and aim for victory!\r\n\r\nTRAINERS FROM ALL OVER COME TOGETHER!\r\nChampions, Elite Four members, Gym Leaders, and visitors from the past! Enjoy adventures together with your favorite Trainers and their Pok\u00e9mon!\r\n\r\nTAKE PHOTOS OF YOUR FAVES!\r\nSelect the Trainers, background, frame, and effects to take a photo worthy of Pok\u00e9star Studios!\r\nYou can include up to three Trainers in a photo!\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: \r\n\u30fbWe recommend a device with at least 2GB of RAM.\r\n\u30fbWe do not guarantee functionality on all devices listed above.\r\n\u30fbThere may be cases where the app does not function properly due to your device\u2019s capabilities, specifications, or particular conditions for using apps.\r\n\u30fbIt may take time to become compatible with the latest OS.",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE MAIN STORY\u2019S ARCEUS ARC UNFOLDS!<br>Sync pairs awaken the power of arc suits\u2014outfits blessed by Arceus\u2014showing the powerful depths of the bond between Pok\u00e9mon and Trainer!<br><br>TEAM UP WITH SYNC PAIRS FROM EVERY REGION!<br>Team up and interact with Trainers from the Hisui region, the Paldea region, and everywhere in between!<br><br>GET TO KNOW YOUR FAVORITE TRAINERS!<br>Interact with Trainers in the Trainer Lodge to deepen your bond and get special photos and stories!<br><br>TRAINERS DON SPECIAL OUTFITS!<br>Trainers appear wearing outfits exclusive to Pok\u00e9mon Masters EX! Enjoy original stories connected to those outfits, too!<br><br>HATCH EGGS &amp; TEAM UP!<br>Hatch Eggs to get new Pok\u00e9mon! Add hatched Pok\u00e9mon to your team, and battle your way to the top!<br><br>ENTER THE FRAY WITH A CUSTOM TEAM!<br>Assemble Trainers and Pok\u00e9mon to take on battles! Create a team all your own, and aim for victory!<br><br>TRAINERS FROM ALL OVER COME TOGETHER!<br>Champions, Elite Four members, Gym Leaders, and visitors from the past! Enjoy adventures together with your favorite Trainers and their Pok\u00e9mon!<br><br>TAKE PHOTOS OF YOUR FAVES!<br>Select the Trainers, background, frame, and effects to take a photo worthy of Pok\u00e9star Studios!<br>You can include up to three Trainers in a photo!<br><br><br>Note: <br>\u30fbWe recommend a device with at least 2GB of RAM.<br>\u30fbWe do not guarantee functionality on all devices listed above.<br>\u30fbThere may be cases where the app does not function properly due to your device\u2019s capabilities, specifications, or particular conditions for using apps.<br>\u30fbIt may take time to become compatible with the latest OS.",
